}

// =====================================================================
// DELIBERATELY NOT DRAWN — facts that are true but are not edges, listed
// here so this file and intercontext.json cannot silently disagree.
//
// * The five MODELS share a name and nothing else. There is no importing, no
//   common type, no serialization that crosses between them. An edge would
//   imply a relationship that does not exist, so none is drawn.
// * cl.lattice ("4D lattice, three projections") has ZERO edges, not because
//   it is unmeasured but because grep for FRONT/SIDE/TOP projection triples
//   across 8 repos returns nothing. Its absence is the finding.
// * cl.address has three edges and all three are ADJACENT ONLY. Nothing in the
//   corpus computes (x, y, t, sig). The edges are drawn dashed to say so.
// * No edge joins any model to any organization. No cell model has ever
//   graduated to patchwork-quilt or purplepincher; the two orgs contain
//   landing pages and git.pp, not cells. The ladder of organizations and the
//   graph of cells do not currently touch.
// * @luciddreamer/* and @cocapn/* have NO edge to any package. Three repos
//   declare those names and none of them is in this corpus, so the wanting
//   is asserted in prior measurements (/tmp/NPM-AUDIT.md) and NOT re-measured
//   here. They are left undrawn rather than asserted.
//
// MEASURED, NOT CLAIMED — corrections to the brief this map was built from:
//   1. "Rust: 0 opcodes" is wrong. quilt-rust implements 9 of 11 (COUNT=9),
//      with an Engine and law checks. WORLD and TIME are the missing two.
//   2. "CONTEST MERGER REVOKE DELEGATE WITHDRAW never implemented anywhere"
//      is wrong. cargo-line-tycoon/substrate-bundle/substrate-sdk.js
//      implements ATTEST:229, CONTEST:242, WITHDRAW:251.
//   3. "algebra.md ONE commit, ever" — it now has 2. 1da6180 (2026-10-18)
//      added result?: any to the Witness type, 2 hours before this map.
//   4. "PRICED-TRAINING.md" has ZERO commits in AI-Writings. The ladder is
//      cited from PRICED-STANDARD.md:100, which points at a file that has
